    "detailed_description": "Buccaneer, a classic game from 1997, thrusts you into a 17th-century Caribbean adventure, offering intense high-seas combat and strategic resource management. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDive into thrilling ship-to-ship battles or lead daring crew boardings. Choose the 'cut-to-the-chase' combat-only option or immerse yourself in the buccaneer world through detailed campaigns. Survive and thrive by upgrading ships, managing content crews, and conquering 21 Caribbean territories. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlunder ports, negotiate, and live to tell your tale! Embark on 6 unique storylines, navigate your buccaneer career, and aim for amnesty or a wealthy retirement. Conquer the seas in this immersive pirate saga!",
    "about_the_game": "Buccaneer, a classic game from 1997, thrusts you into a 17th-century Caribbean adventure, offering intense high-seas combat and strategic resource management. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDive into thrilling ship-to-ship battles or lead daring crew boardings. Choose the 'cut-to-the-chase' combat-only option or immerse yourself in the buccaneer world through detailed campaigns. Survive and thrive by upgrading ships, managing content crews, and conquering 21 Caribbean territories. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlunder ports, negotiate, and live to tell your tale! Embark on 6 unique storylines, navigate your buccaneer career, and aim for amnesty or a wealthy retirement. Conquer the seas in this immersive pirate saga!",
    "short_description": "BUCCANEER is a 17th-century Caribbean 3D adventure that blends high-seas combat with resource management. Opt for combat-only, engage in ship-to-ship battles or lead crew boardings. Dive into the buccaneer world through campaigns. Plunder, negotiate, survive, and live to tell the tale!",
